<title>INDIA: India Container Corp 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India Container Corp 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     968.0  vs    522.3</p>
<p>    Income from operations   5,328.3  vs  3,893.7</p>
<p>    Other income		   137.0  vs     66.8</p>
<p>    Total expenditure	  3,693.0  vs  2,787.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   100.7  vs     89.3</p>
<p>Taxes (includes for</p>
<p>    earlier years also)	  678.3  vs    537.4</p>
<p>NOTE: State-run Container Corporation of India Ltd (CONCOR) is a bulk-cargo handling company.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
